OL,3,GNEWSA'Help us keep chimps cosy this
OL,4,Awinter', says zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FBring out your pre-loved bedding -
OL,7,Forangutans and chimpanzees at Dudley
OL,8,FZoo are in need of snuggly items to
OL,9,Fhelp make their wintry days extra cosy.
OL,11,FThe primates regularly make use of bed
OL,12,Fsheets, towels, pillowcases and duvet
OL,13,Fcovers to make their nests nice and
OL,14,Fwarm - or just as something to play
OL,15,Fwith.
OL,17,FBut stocks are running low and the zoo
OL,18,Fis appealing for donations.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
