OL,3,GNEWSA'Help us keep chimps cosy this
OL,4,Awinter', says zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FJodie Dryden, head of primates, said:
OL,7,F"As you can imagine, the linen doesn't
OL,8,Flast long in their hands and we're
OL,9,Fconstantly going through our stockpile
OL,10,Fto provide the animals with a fresh
OL,11,Fsupply."
